    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a topdown shooter.\u00a0 Hard-boiled gunplay and skull crushing close combat. Play a special forces soldier, infiltrate hideouts and attack without being seen, select the appropriate type of weapon for the mission, and when you are assigned only one, use it with caution. Eliminate all enemies, explode barrels and vehicles. Play against time to finish your missions. Hold your position until reinforcements arrive, while the enemies attack. Change weapons if necessary, pistol, rifle, bazooka or machine gun.</p>",
